diff -ruN orig/debian/changelog new/debian/changelog
--- a/debian/changelog	2026-03-01 02:47:50.000000000 -0800
+++ b/debian/changelog	2026-11-04 14:30:22.301230830 -0800
@@ -1,3 +1,45 @@
+rrdtool (1.9.0-2.1+supermox1) unstable; urgency=medium
+
+  * init.d/rrdcached, which this package installs as /etc/init.d/rrdcached,
+    reads /etc/default/rrdcached the way the unit's EnvironmentFile did, passes
+    -l unix:/var/run/rrdcached.sock explicitly (Debian gets that socket from
+    service-manager socket activation, which sysvinit does not provide) and
+    forks with -p /run/rrdcached.pid instead of staying in the foreground for
+    a service manager that tracks the process itself.
+
+ -- SuperMox <noreply@supermox.me>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 19:05:00 -0800
+
+rrdtool (1.9.0-2.1+supermox) unstable; urgency=medium
+
+  * SuperMox fork: rrdcached runs under sysvinit, so nothing in this package
+    touches systemd any more.
+  * debian/rules: configure with --with-systemdsystemunitdir=no, which is what
+    makes configure.ac stop generating etc/rrdcached.service and
+    etc/rrdcached.socket at all, and empty override_dh_installsystemd so debhelper
+    neither installs the units nor calls systemctl to enable them.
+  * debian/rules: override_dh_installinit calls dh_installinit -prrdcached
+    --name=rrdcached, installing debian/rrdcached.rrdcached.init (copied in from
+    init.d/rrdcached by scripts/apply-patches.sh) as /etc/init.d/rrdcached and
+    enabling it with update-rc.d, the way every other PVE service is started here.
+  * debian/rrdcached.install: drop the two usr/lib/systemd/system lines, since
+    those files are no longer built.
+  * debian/rrdcached.maintscript: removed. Its only entry was
+    "rm_conffile /etc/init.d/rrdcached 1.9.0-1~ rrdcached", which would have
+    deleted the init script this fork installs.
+  * debian/patches/systemd-service-defaults.patch: removed from the quilt series;
+    it only edited the systemd unit and its /etc/default/rrdcached template.
+  * debian/tests/rrdcached-test: removed along with its stanza in
+    debian/tests/control - the test drives the daemon through systemctl, so it
+    cannot work without systemd.
+  * The rrdcached init script now ships from this package, so config/init-scripts.txt
+    hands it to rrdcached instead of supermox-ve, and supermox-ve no longer
+    installs it (two packages owning /etc/init.d/rrdcached would conflict).
+  * Version is 1.9.0-2.1+supermox: the '+' starts a dpkg revision, so it sorts
+    above Devuan's 1.9.0-2.1+b3 and apt upgrades the node onto this fork instead
+    of keeping the distro build.
+
+ -- SuperMox <noreply@supermox.me>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 14:16:07 -0800
+
 rrdtool (1.9.0-2.1) unstable; urgency=medium
 
   * Non-maintainer upload.
